      "user_title": "",
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>I actually followed along with my collection of cards. It was fun! :)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>And now we know for sure who Count Barzok is.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>EDIT: Also, this was really useful from a fan designer perspective. I've always known that incap powers were meant to represent what the other heroes do now that one of their number is down, but actually visualizing what that means has never been easy. I've already got tons of ideas to redo my hero incap powers for better flavor instead of \"well here's three random things and one's kind of like one her one-shots I guess\".</p>",
